    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Long Gabardine Ellingham Fit-and-flare Car Coat", "bodyKo": "Evolving our signature rainwear silhouettes, the Ellingham fit-and-flare car coat is cut to an A-line shape with wider sleeves and a fuller skirt. Made in Yorkshire from water-resistant gabardine and treated for a soft finish, the design features raglan sleeves for a relaxed look and curlicue-shaped pockets, inspired by an archival trench. Inside is Burberry Check cotton lining in seasonal clam beige.", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/81150371/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Details", "bodyKo": "Single-breasted button closure#B buckle belt#Side button welt pockets#Belted cuffs#Burberry Check lining and undercollar#Comes with a garment bag · Single-breasted button closure · B buckle belt · Side button welt pockets · Belted cuffs · Burberry Check lining and undercollar · Comes with a garment bag · Slim fit: this style is cut to a fitted silhouette. Fits true to size, take your normal size.", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/81150371/2.jpg", "reverse": true}],
