    tags: ["burberry", "bb-women", "bb-women-coats", "bb-women-coats-jackets", "bb-women-new", "bb-women-trench-coats"],
    descriptionKo: "Inspired by our heritage styles, the Summerside trench coat is tailored to a classic fit with a neat, narrow silhouette and three-quarter length set-in sleeves. Debuted on the Summer 2026 runway, the raffia‑effect design is jacquard‑woven with check and features a wet‑look coated finish. At the back, a suede label is detailed with the Equestrian Knight Design in antiqued metal – a direct nod to the materiality of the protective armour.",
