    descriptionKo: "Shaped for volume, this new edition of the Fitzrovia trench coat is crafted from denim detailed with topstitching and hardware in an antique finish. The A-line style is cut to a relaxed fit with unstructured shoulders and wider sleeves, while an archival trench inspires the curlicue shape of the pockets. The storm shield – a heritage detail designed to allow rain to run off the back – is exaggerated to emphasise the coat’s flowing line. Inside is a Burberry Check cotton lining in signature sand beige.",
