    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Short Denim Fitzrovia Trench Coat", "bodyKo": "Shaped for volume, this new edition of the Fitzrovia trench coat is crafted from denim detailed with topstitching and hardware in an antique finish. The A-line style is cut to a relaxed fit with unstructured shoulders and wider sleeves, while an archival trench inspires the curlicue shape of the pockets. The storm shield – a heritage detail designed to allow rain to run off the back – is exaggerated to emphasise the coat’s flowing line. Inside is a Burberry Check cotton lining in signature sand beige.", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/81263641/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Details", "bodyKo": "Relaxed fit: a looser cut than our regular fit. · Length: 75cm/29.5in (size UK 8) · Model wears UK 8 and is 179cm/5ft 10in · Outer: 100% cotton · Lining: 100% polyester · Pocket lining: 65% polyester, 35% cotton · Specialist dry clean · Made in Italy", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/81263641/2.jpg", "reverse": true}],
