    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Beyond Wear Radiance Primer", "bodyKo": "Discover Burberry Beyond Wear Radiance Primer, a long-lasting luminous primer providing 24-hour hydration* and active protection against environmental factors. #Formulated with 96% natural-origin ingredients, this lightweight, refreshing and hydrating primer instantly creates a lit-from-within glow while reducing skin dullness over time. Its potent formula protects against external environmental factors and respects the skin barrier. #Use alone to hydrate and illuminate your skin or apply with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised radiant matte finish. #*Clinically tested on 20 volunteers. #HOW TO USE:", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/40852241/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Details", "bodyKo": "Wear primer alone for enhanced radiance and boosted moisture.#Apply primer as the initial step before foundation to prep the skin, providing hydration and glow.#Mix primer with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised, radiant matte finish.#Use primer as a highlighter to accentuate your cheekbones, the bridge of your nose and the Cupid’s bow. · Formulated with 96% natural-origin ingredients, this lightweight, refreshing and hydrating primer instantly creates a lit-from-within glow while reducing skin dullness over time. Its potent formula protects against external environmental factors and respects the skin barrier. · Use alone to hydrate and illuminate your skin or apply with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised radiant matte finish. · *Clinically tested on 20 volunteers. · HOW TO USE: · Wear primer alone for enhanced radiance and boosted moisture. · Apply primer as the initial step before foundation to prep the skin, providing hydration and glow. · Mix primer with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised, radiant matte finish.", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/40852241/2.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Wear primer alone for enhanced radiance and boosted moisture.#Apply primer as the initial step before foundation to prep the skin, providing hydration and glow.#Mix primer with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised, radiant matte finish.#Use primer as a highlighter to accentuate your cheekbones, the bridge of your nose and the Cupid’s bow.", "Formulated with 96% natural-origin ingredients, this lightweight, refreshing and hydrating primer instantly creates a lit-from-within glow while reducing skin dullness over time. Its potent formula protects against external environmental factors and respects the skin barrier.", "Use alone to hydrate and illuminate your skin or apply with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised radiant matte finish.", "*Clinically tested on 20 volunteers.", "HOW TO USE:", "Wear primer alone for enhanced radiance and boosted moisture.", "Apply primer as the initial step before foundation to prep the skin, providing hydration and glow.", "Mix primer with Burberry Beyond Wear Perfecting Matte Foundation for a customised, radiant matte finish.", "Use primer as a highlighter to accentuate your cheekbones, the bridge of your nose and the Cupid’s bow.", "30ml/1.0fl oz", "Made in Spain"],
